# Composure — .composure/.gitignore · single source of truth for what travels.
# TRACKED across machines & apps: campaigns/ (active), frameworks/, research/,
#   project configs (no-bandaids.json, sentinel.json, …), and this file.
# IGNORED (per-machine / rebuildable / noise) below. The repo's ROOT .gitignore
#   must NOT blanket-ignore .composure/* — that overrides this file and drops
#   campaigns/frameworks/research. Composure auto-heals a legacy root blanket.

# Rebuildable code graph (large, machine-absolute paths)
graph/

# Cortex memory (per-developer; canonical store at ~/.composure/cortex/)
cortex/
cortex.db*

# Worktrees / scratch — node_modules-like volume + noise, never committed
workspaces/

# Ephemeral session state + locks
current-task.json
last-health-check
orient-shown
hook-activity.log
task-sync-debug.jsonl
*.lock

# Completed campaigns archive stays local; ACTIVE campaigns/*.json travel
campaigns/archived/

# Local safety copies — .bak/.orig files and pre-migration snapshots (see AGENTS.md "Backups"). Never tracked.
backups/

# In-repo launch kickoffs (session-launcher.mjs writes here so a sandboxed runtime can read its own kickoff file). Per-machine, ephemeral. Never tracked.
panel-state/
